# Everything in this folder is local working material EXCEPT the published pages,
# their screenshots, and this README. Deny by default, then allow the few files
# that belong in the public repo.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!graft-guide.html
!graft-in-practice.html
!img/
!img/*.png

# Explicit reminders of what must never be committed:
#   larql_copy/            third-party clone (chrishayuk/larql, Apache-2.0) - link upstream instead
#   transcript.txt         verbatim transcript of someone else's video
#   gpt6_summary.txt       derived from that transcript
#   .ignore/               raw terminal logs containing local machine details
#   HANDOFF.md             local session state
